{"op":"add","path":"/elements/faq-1","value":{"type":"Text","props":{"text":"Yes. Upgrade or downgrade at any time from your billing settings. When you upgrade, we prorate the difference to the day; when you downgrade, the new rate applies from the start of your next billing period.","variant":"body"},"children":[]}}
{"op":"add","path":"/elements/faq-2","value":{"type":"Text","props":{"text":"You will get an email at 80% and 100% of your limit. Files stay available in read-only mode until you upgrade or free up space — we never delete anything automatically.","variant":"body"},"children":[]}}
{"op":"add","path":"/elements/faq-3","value":{"type":"Text","props":{"text":"We offer 50% off Pro and Team for registered nonprofits and accredited educational institutions. Apply from the billing page with your verification documents.","variant":"body"},"children":[]}}
{"op":"add","path":"/elements/faq-4","value":{"type":"Text","props":{"text":"Yearly plans are billed once per year and save 20% compared with paying monthly. Your renewal date and amount are shown in billing settings 30 days before each charge.","variant":"body"},"children":[]}}
{"op":"add","path":"/elements/faq-5","value":{"type":"Text","props":{"text":"Subscriptions can be cancelled at any time. We offer a full refund on annual plans within the first 14 days, and a pro-rated refund on monthly plans within the first 72 hours.","variant":"body"},"children":[]}}
{"op":"add","path":"/elements/cta-banner","value":{"type":"Card","props":{"title":"Not sure which plan fits?","description":"Tell us about your team and workload — we will recommend a plan and set it up for you in under an hour."},"children":["cta-banner-actions","cta-banner-note"]}}
